docs {
  # Update HKI
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `PUT /api/hki/:id`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token  
  **Roles:** admin, dosen, mahasiswa
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Request)
  
  ### Path Parameters
  | Param | Type | Required |
  |-------|------|----------|
  | id | UUID | ✅ |
  
  ### Body (multipart/form-data)
  ```typescript
  interface UpdateHKIDTO {
    judul: string;         // Required
    jenis_hki: string;     // Required
    inventor: string;      // Required
    pemegang_hak: string;  // Required
    sub_jenis_ciptaan?: string;
    nomor_permohonan?: string;
    tanggal_permohonan?: string;
    status_hki?: string;
    deskripsi?: string;
    sertifikatFile?: File;
    dokumenFile?: File;
    remove_sertifikatFile?: boolean;
    remove_dokumenFile?: boolean;
  }
  ```
  
  | Field | Type | Required |
  |-------|------|----------|
  | judul | string | ✅ |
  | jenis_hki | string | ✅ |
  | inventor | string | ✅ |
  | pemegang_hak | string | ✅ |
  | remove_sertifikatFile | boolean | ❌ |
  | remove_dokumenFile | boolean | ❌ |
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengupdate data HKI",
    "data": { ... }
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|  
  | 400 | Field required |
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
  | 404 | Data HKI tidak ditemukan |
}
